    'Reorder point and safety stock: enter average daily demand and its standard deviation, average lead time and its standard deviation, and the service level you want. The result is the reorder point, the safety stock behind it in units and days, average and maximum stock if you give an order quantity, and a table of safety stock at 90% to 99.9% service.',
